<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>New: Creator Hub on Pay2View!</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        color: #333;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 30px auto;
        background: #fff;
        padding: 25px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      }
      h2 {
        color: #000000;
        text-align: center;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      ul {
        padding-left: 20px;
      }
      .cta {
        display: block;
        text-align: center;
        background: #000000;
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 20px auto;
        width: fit-content;
      }
      .cta:hover {
        background: #000000;
      }
      .highlight {
        color: #2b7cff;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .highlight-earn {
        color: #28a745;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .creator-hub {
        background: #f0f6ff;
        border-left: 4px solid #2b7cff;
        padding: 15px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      footer {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #777;
        margin-top: 30px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        padding-top: 10px;
      }
      a.unsubscribe {
        color: #777;
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Introducing Creator Hub 🚀</h2>
      <p>Hello {{username}},</p>
      <p>We’re excited to announce <span class="highlight">Creator Hub</span> — a brand-new feature on Pay2View that makes sharing your content easier than ever!</p>

      <div class="creator-hub">
        🎉 <b>What’s new?</b>
        <ul>
          <li>Share <b>all your uploaded content at once</b> with your audience — no need to share files individually.</li>
          <li>Include your <b>social media links</b> so fans can follow you on Instagram, TikTok, Twitter/X, Facebook, and Snapchat.</li>
          <li>Your <b>bio and profile info</b> are automatically displayed, making it easier for viewers to know you and support your work.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>See your hub and start sharing: <a href="https://www.pay2view.io/creator/{{username}}">View My Creator Hub</a></p>
      </div>

      <p>Creators are already earning <span class="highlight-earn">#50,000, #100,000, even #500,000+</span> weekly by sharing content through Pay2View. Don’t miss out — update your bio and social media links in your profile and start sharing via Creator Hub today!</p>

      <a href="https://www.pay2view.io/dashboard" class="cta">Go to Dashboard & Update Profile</a>

      <footer>
        Pay2View Team<br>
        <a href="mailto:hello@pay2view.io">hello@pay2view.io</a> | 
        <a href="https://www.pay2view.io" target="_blank">www.pay2view.io</a>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
